## 3. The canonical 6-layer model

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1. STUDY SESSION WORKFLOW                              │
│     planning · awaiting_confirmation · topic_active     │
│     replanning · paused · completed · abandoned         │
│     Answers: WHERE ARE WE IN THE SESSION?              │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  2. TOPIC / RUN WORKFLOW                                │
│     queued · active · understood · flagged_gap          │
│     capped_out · deferred                               │
│     Answers: WHAT LEARNING PHASE IS THIS TOPIC IN?     │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  3. AGENT LOOP                                          │
│     Reason → Act → Observe → Reason → ...              │
│     Bounded: maxIterations = 6 (POLICY constant).      │
│     Answers: WHAT SHOULD HAPPEN NEXT?                  │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  4. CONTEXT MANAGER                                     │
│     manifest.mjs: setName → file list → assembled sys  │
│     Answers: WHAT SHOULD THE LLM SEE FOR THIS STEP?   │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  5. HARNESS                                             │
│     harness.js: permissions, schema, state, budget,     │
│     concurrency, idempotency                            │
│     Answers: IS THIS ACTION ALLOWED? EXECUTE IT.       │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  6. DETERMINISTIC EDUCATION ENGINE                      │
│     education-engine.js: scoring, thresholds, mastery   │
│     evidence, state transitions, attempt limits         │
│     Answers: WHAT ACTUALLY HAPPENED? RECORD IT.        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

