## 4. State machines — two levels

### 4.1 Session state machine (`state-machine.js`) ✅

```
planning → awaiting_confirmation → topic_active ⇄ replanning
                                       │
                                    paused → topic_active | planning | replanning
                                       │
                                 completed | abandoned | cancelled
```

### 4.2 Topic / run state machine (`state-machine.js`) ✅

```
queued → active → understood
                → flagged_gap → queued (re-queued by replan)
                → capped_out → deferred → queued
                → deferred
```

### 4.3 Policy constants (`state-machine.js → POLICY`) ✅

```javascript
MAX_TOPICS: 12
DEFAULT_MAX_ATTEMPTS: 3        // policy table may override
CRAM_MAX_ATTEMPTS: 1
PASS_THRESHOLD: 0.70           // policy table may override
MAX_ITERATIONS_PER_STEP: 6     // harness constant, not a model choice
SESSION_TOOL_CALL_CAP: 40
DEFERRED_RETRIES_PER_SESSION: 1
INTENT_MAX_CHARS: 240
```

### 4.4 Rejection codes (`state-machine.js → REJECTION_CODES`) ✅

`study_prep_disabled` · `session_not_found` · `tool_not_permitted` ·
`tool_schema_invalid` · `invalid_state_transition` · `attempt_cap_exceeded` ·
`strategy_not_permitted` · `prerequisite_violation` · `topic_not_in_syllabus` ·
`plan_too_large` · `duplicate_topic` · `deferred_retry_used` ·
`insufficient_balance` · `teach_back_gate` · `agent_loop_cap` ·
`session_tool_call_cap` · `unknown_action`

### 4.5 Decision nodes (`state-machine.js → DECISION_NODES`) ✅

`harness_rejection` · `plan_validated` · `plan_confirmed` · `plan_adjusted` ·
`topic_started` · `practice_generated` · `practice_scored` ·
`strategy_offered` · `teach_back_confirmed` · `topic_advanced` ·
`topic_deferred` · `topic_flagged` · `session_concluded` · `session_paused`

