## 5. How the agent loop runs

The loop is **durable and wake-driven** (`agent-loop.js` + `wiring.js`).

| Wake trigger | Fired by | Agent decides |
|---|---|---|
| `session_started` | Learner prompt / `start_study_prep_session` tool | Research, then propose plan |
| `plan_confirmed` | Learner taps Approve (`POST /confirm`) | Which topic first |
| `attempt_scored` | Server scoring (`POST /submit`) | Only at decision points |
| `teachback_confirmed` | Learner taps done (`POST /teach-back-done`) | Retest |
| `replan_requested` | Learner (`POST /plan`) | Reorder or drop topics |
| `budget_paused` / `resumed` | Wallet event | Continue or close |

**Fast path — no model wake needed:**

| Situation | Who acts |
|---|---|
| Score ≥ threshold → advance | Harness (`advanceTopic`) |
| Teach-back confirmed → retest | Harness (`confirmTeachBack`) |
| Score < threshold, attempts left | **Agent** |
| Attempts exhausted | **Agent** |
| All topics settled → summary | **Agent** (`concludeSession`) |

