## 9. The harness (`harness.js`) ✅

Full pipeline for every proposed action:

| # | Check | Reject code |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Session found and owned by learner | `session_not_found` |
| 2 | Tool is permitted in current state | `tool_not_permitted` |
| 3 | Arguments match schema | `tool_schema_invalid` |
| 4 | State transition is valid | `invalid_state_transition` |
| 5 | Attempt cap not exceeded | `attempt_cap_exceeded` |
| 6 | Strategy is in the approved library | `strategy_not_permitted` |
| 7 | Prerequisite order respected | `prerequisite_violation` |
| 8 | Topic in approved syllabus | `topic_not_in_syllabus` |
| 9 | Plan size ≤ 12 | `plan_too_large` |
| 10 | No duplicate topics | `duplicate_topic` |
| 11 | Deferred retry slot unused | `deferred_retry_used` |
| 12 | Wallet can cover the charge | `insufficient_balance` |
| 13 | Teach-back gate for retests | `teach_back_gate` |
| 14 | Session tool-call cap | `session_tool_call_cap` |

Rejections are returned as **observations** — the agent reads the code and
adapts. It never retries the identical call.

