## 10. Education engine (`education-engine.js`) ✅

Pure functions — no DB, no LLM, no clock.

- `scoreAttempt(answerKey, answers)` — deterministic scoring
- `applyThreshold({ score, passThreshold, attemptsUsed, maxAttempts })` — `{ passed, capped, attemptsRemaining }`
- `topicOutcome({ passed, capped })` — `understood | capped_out | retest_offered`
- `masteryWriteBack({ currentMastery, knowledgeConfidence, score, passed, attemptsUsed })` — exponential blend
- `estimateSessionCost({ topicCount })` — plan-card estimate
- `STRATEGY_LIBRARY` + `isPermittedStrategy(strategy)` — the five permitted strategies
- `STUDY_PREP_COST` — `COINS_PER_PRACTICE: 2`, `PRACTICES_PER_TOPIC: 2`, `LOOP_LLM_COINS_PER_STEP: 1`

