## 14. Streaming chat UI 🆕

This is the primary remaining work. Everything else in this section is new.

### 14.1 Three-element stream pattern

```
[thinking block]      ← collapsible, auto-closes when done
[tool group]          ← collapsible, rows stream in one at a time
[activity message]    ← large plain text, never collapsed
[card]                ← plan, session, score, gate — not part of trace
```

### 14.2 Thinking blocks

- SSE `thinking_start` → open collapsed `<details>`, show "Thinking…"
- SSE `thinking_delta` → append to body
- SSE `thinking_end` → update summary to "Thought for Xs", auto-close
- **Never stored** in events. Requires extended thinking on API calls.
- On reload: "Thought for Xs" with no expandable body — expected.

### 14.3 Tool call groups

Consecutive `research` operation calls → one `tool_group` block.
Single propose/action/synthesis calls → `tool_single` with label + timing.

### 14.4 Descriptive row format — no backend names

```
[type pill]  Headline — short plain-English action
             Description — one sentence, what is happening
             ✓ / ✕  Result
             [agent / system]
```

Pill types: `research` · `draft` · `verification` · `action` · `reflection` · `synthesis`
Actor labels: `agent` (model decided) · `system` (platform executed)

### 14.5 Activity message

Model's `text` content blocks — 16px/500-weight plain text, no bubble.

### 14.6 SSE event contract 🆕

Endpoint: `GET /study-prep/sessions/:id/stream`

```
event: thinking_start   data: { block_index }
event: thinking_delta   data: { block_index, text }
event: thinking_end     data: { block_index, elapsed_ms }
event: tool_group_open  data: { group_id, label }
event: tool_row         data: { group_id|call_id, type, headline, description, result, actor, bad }
event: tool_group_close data: { group_id }
event: tool_single_open data: { call_id, label, ok, ms }
event: tool_single_close data: { call_id }
event: activity         data: { text }
event: card             data: { kind: "plan"|"session"|"score"|"gate"|"summary", payload }
event: topic_update     data: { topic_ref, status, tag }
event: wallet_update    data: { spent, wallet, ceiling }
event: session_update   data: { status, wakes }
event: harness_reject   data: { code, message }
event: done             data: {}
```

### 14.7 Client rendering rules

| Event | Action |
|---|---|
| `thinking_*` | Open/stream/close thinking block |
| `tool_group_*` / `tool_single_*` | Open/stream rows/close tool block |
| `tool_row` | Append `.tl-row` inside current block |
| `activity` | Append plain `.act` div |
| `card` | Render plan, session, score, gate, or summary card |
| `topic_update` | Mutate session card row in place |
| `wallet_update` | Update session card footer |
| `harness_reject` | Append `verification` row with `bad: true` |
| `done` | Enable input bar |

**Rebuild on reload:** reconstruct trace from events. Thinking not stored —
blocks show "Thought for Xs" only.

