## 18. Decisions

| # | Decision | Choice |
|---|---|---|
| D1 | Where does the loop run? | **JS `runAgentToolLoop` / `study-prep/agent-loop.js`**. Python agent stays out. |
| D2 | Show model-written `intent` per call? | **Yes** — bounded (240 chars), treated as untrusted display text |
| D3 | How many workspace files? | **All of them** — they already exist. Add via manifest.mjs only. |
| D4 | Fast path without waking the model? | **Yes** for advance and post-teach-back retest. Wake agent for strategy, cap-out, replan, summary. |
| D5 | Plan confirmation mechanism | **REST `POST /sessions/:id/confirm`** (learner-owned gate) |
| D6 | Iteration caps | Step: 6 (POLICY.MAX_ITERATIONS_PER_STEP). Session: 40 (POLICY.SESSION_TOOL_CALL_CAP). |
| D7 | Deferred retry | One per session (POLICY.DEFERRED_RETRIES_PER_SESSION). New run, attempts reset. |
| D8 | Topic cap | 12 (POLICY.MAX_TOPICS). |
| D9 | Budget ceiling | `min(1.5 × estimate, wallet)`. 402 on zero. |
| D10 | Strategy policy | Harness enforces `isPermittedStrategy`. Agent chooses from the 5. `STRATEGIES.md` guides. |
| D11 | Show reasoning tokens? | **Yes** — ephemeral thinking blocks. Never stored. Extended thinking required. |
| D12 | Backend names in UI? | **Never.** Descriptive headline + description + result only. |
| D13 | Actor labels in UI? | **`agent`** (model decided) · **`system`** (platform executed). |
| D14 | Thinking on reload? | "Thought for Xs" summary, no body. Expected and intentional. |
| D15 | Group vs single tool display? | Consecutive research calls → `tool_group`. Single propose/action → `tool_single` with timing. |
| D16 | Context assembly timing? | **Per LLM loop** via `loadContext(setName)`. Not once per session. |
| D17 | Stable vs dynamic context? | Files in the manifest set are stable (cache candidates). Learner data is always rebuilt. |
| D18 | MD file discovery? | `manifest.mjs` is the registry. Frontmatter discovery is not planned — the manifest contract tests enforce the closed set. |
| D19 | Operation → set mapping? | The six manifest sets map to operations: planning, research, teaching, reflection, strategies, safety. The loop infers the set from the current observation type. |

